  <sharedProfiles>
    <profile name="Warrior Strategist" id="cb03-8115-df85-19ac" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle round, one unit from your army with this ability can use it when its unit is targeted with a Stratagem. If it does, reduce the CP cost of that use of that Stratagem by 1CP.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Damaged: 1-4 Wounds Remaining" id="abf6-e340-d8e8-5486" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model has 1-4 wounds remaining, each time this model makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Damaged: 1-5 Wounds Remaining" id="e6a-44ad-c190-51c5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model has 1-5 wounds remaining, each time this model makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Litanies of Sanctity" id="8d73-2ecd-2b3c-3f18" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly ^^**Grey Knights^^** unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12&quot; of this model. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
  </sharedProfiles>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Gate of Infinity" id="6a5e-1316-2d87-93c5" hidden="false">
      <description>If your Army Faction is **^^Grey Knights^^**, at the end of your opponent’s Fight phase, you can select a number of units from your army that are on the battlefield (excluding units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units), providing every model in those units has this ability. The maximum number of units you can select depends on the battle size, as follows:

Incursion - Up to 2 units
Strike Force - Up to 3 units
Onslaught - Up to 4 units

Once you have made your selections, remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Eye of the Prognosticars" id="5622-43f1-c599-8ec7" hidden="false">
      <description>Units from your army with the Teleport Assault ability replace that ability with this one.

Each time you target this unit with a Stratagem, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if this unit is within range of an objective marker you control: on a 5+, you gain 1CP.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
