                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">^^**Grey Knights^^** model only. Once per battle round, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, you can target the bearer&apos;s unit with the Fire Overwatch Stratagem or Heroic Intervention Stratagem for 0CP, and can do so even if you have already targeted a different unit with that Stratagem this turn.</characteristic>
