                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">^^**Grey Knights^^** model only.  Each time an enemy unit within Engagement Range of the bearer&apos;s unit Falls Back, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, roll one D6: on a 2-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers D3+3 mortal wounds. These mortal wounds are Psychic Attacks.</characteristic>
