                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">^^**Grey Knights^^** model only. At the start of your Shooting phase, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, select one enemy unit within 24&quot; of and visible to the bearer; that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
