                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">^^**Grey Knights^^** model only. At the start of your Shooting phase, if the bearer&apos;s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, the bearer&apos;s unit can make a Normal Move of up to D6&quot; and, until the end of the turn, the bearer&apos;s unit is not eligible to declare a Charge.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
