                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">An Attached unit can only use one Psychic Fortitude at a time - while a Leader with one of these traits is attached to a Bodyguard unit with a different one of these traits, only one can be in effect; select which at the Declare Battle Formations step - that trait then applies to the Attached unit until either the Leader unit or the Bodyguard unit is destroyed, at which point the remaining unit&apos;s Psychic Fortitude comes into effect.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
    </selectionEntryGroup>
