                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Infantry^^** model only. Improve the Strength and Damage characteristics of the bearer&apos;s melee weapons by 1. The bearer&apos;s melee weapons have the **[ANTI-CHAOS 4+]** ability.</characteristic>
