              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Model with the Heroic rank or higher. If the bearer is in your Crusade army, then at the Select Crusade Blessings step, if you are the Underdog, you can select one additional Crusade Blessing.</characteristic>
