              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Model with the Blooded rank or higher. At the start of the Fight phase, each enemy unit within 3&quot; of the bearer must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test if it is a **^^Chaos^^** unit.</characteristic>
