              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Model with the Blooded rank or higher. At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to the bearer. Roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if it is a **^^Chaos^^** unit. On a 4+, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
