                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Model with the Battle-hardened rank or higher. While the bearer is within range of an objective marker that you control, enemy units that are set up on the battlefield from Reserves cannot be set up within 12&quot; of that objective marker.</characteristic>
